  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third phase of project with the National Forest Board and the All- Russia Institute of Continuing Education in Forestry in Pushkino, Moscow Oblast. Project objectives are training in market-based decision-making of Federal Chief Foresters and their deputies. After completion, they are expected to be able to formulate and implement a Federal forest policy, leading to sustainable forest management.</narrative>
